[{"title":"灌禾","author":"吴与弼","text":"田头一一荷锄过，自放寒流灌晚禾。\n随分不辞筋力苦，坐看明月好怀多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东斋读晦庵先生诗次韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"朝朝黄卷自埋头，物外从教春复秋。\n座接好山青绕屋，门迎活水绿平沟。\n旧花匝径红如织，新竹成林翠欲流。\n课罢几回閒徙倚，谁怜心赏十分幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠山中人","author":"吴与弼","text":"徐步春山日未晡，石桥流水竹扶疏。\n为求桑柘乘时种，一一烦君手自锄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游山","author":"吴与弼","text":"东风新霁好怀多，又复携琴访薜萝。\n幽赏正宜穷窈窕，遐观时喜陟嵯峨。\n寸心好共寒流淡，一气应同淑景和。\n迤逦不妨归步晚，暖烟凉月助吟哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游山","author":"吴与弼","text":"丽景寻幽日日宜，杳然身世在皇羲。\n芳林剩馥徐行际，凉石浓阴小憩时。\n胜地到来心自醉，吉人逢处话忘疲。\n夜深更酹家山月，不惮烟村归去迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9474,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桐冈茅屋","author":"吴与弼","text":"远却嚣尘制芰衣，野塘安处憺忘归。\n良畴佳圃怡朝夕，白水青山省是非。\n醉里乾坤类箕颍，閒中今古在皇羲。\n人生肥遁如斯足，多少功名与愿违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9475,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中倦卧偶思年二十四时寓居东坪与诸生夜读赋玩月诗微吟一过神思洒然遂次旧韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"旧吟诵罢病魂清，犹幸灵台一点明。\n锻鍊虽然愧金锡，战兢不敢步渊冰。\n未容馀日甘衰朽，尚拟诸生更老成。\n世泽依然诗礼在，好将尘虑静中澄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9476,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懒吟","author":"吴与弼","text":"时止时行学养疴，人心天气共融和。\n好怀却怕诗拘束，不似前时苦思多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9477,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同士当度横琴岭","author":"吴与弼","text":"仄径依微落照残，行临绝岭暂怡颜。\n他年记得耽幽处，烟树参差远近山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9478,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄士当","author":"吴与弼","text":"两地相思渴一逢，忽从华里共春风。\n通家不减平生好，指掌深论别后功。\n翠岭遥承扶疾送，狂言多谢放怀容。\n人事相应从渐省，好伸前约向中庸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9479,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同孙脩撰曰恭赋诗留石源黄宅","author":"吴与弼","text":"野径联镳日，山楼对榻时。\n素心同似水，清兴各留诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9480,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠曰恭","author":"吴与弼","text":"大地收新雨，春山张旧容。\n高人淹信宿，佳兴共和风。\n丽泽资方好，离歌唱却慵。\n更怀贤叔氏，何日定重逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9481,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题友琴轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"欲将心事托云和，高辟幽轩远绮罗。\n好景洽来人似醉，纤私绝处海无波。\n天高地迥云烟散，电掣雷轰风雨多。\n我亦平生耽此趣，把君诗卷重摩挲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9482,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿黄徵君馆","author":"吴与弼","text":"负炎困行迈，息肩称幽怀。\n嚣尘自兹隔，好景从天来。\n林静风荏苒，池清月徘徊。\n细交知己谈，佳兴何悠哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9483,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题北溪松隐","author":"吴与弼","text":"县北溪头松几株，婆娑长荫隐君居。\n绿阴寂寂閒吟处，清籁悠悠醉梦馀。\n老干冰霜饶冻裂，盘根雨露饱沾濡。\n不知桃李春风态，得拟高标万一欤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9484,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠宗人士彰","author":"吴与弼","text":"笋舆遥辱到清溪，霜鬓俱怜识面迟。\n绿酒细论宗族谊，青灯频析古今疑。\n光先事业根须厚，为已功夫志莫移。\n别后分阴勤爱惜，重逢未卜是何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南园","author":"吴与弼","text":"尘世谁无数亩园，个中清致几人怜。\n石桥近接云烟墅，苔径旁通薜荔泉。\n灵药嘉蔬纷绕舍，碧桃红杏烂遮天。\n幅巾方杖逍遥处，世与羲轩共杳然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题双贞堂","author":"吴与弼","text":"孀居重见古今悲，一室双贞天下奇。\n粹玉精金同姓字，霜松雪竹表心期。\n高踪合继前贤传，懿范宜为后辈师。\n多少高谈仁义者，几人无愧柏舟辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题大和堂","author":"吴与弼","text":"天人一理费形容，须向三关透后通。\n一气坱然穹壤塞，四时顺布古今同。\n絪缊总是吾心妙，保合应须日用功。\n琴到无弦何所道，始知君子只中庸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题听松轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"曾向高轩共好音，乾坤浩荡境沉沉。\n恍然指下迷宫羽，不信人间有古今。\n瀑涧夜寒鸣雨歇，风林昼静落花深。\n回看胜事已成梦，难写凄凉一片心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹所","author":"吴与弼","text":"富买江干脩竹林，洞门苔径蔚沉沉。\n略无尘土杂幽梦，时有天风来好音。\n千亩秋霜君子操，万竿春雨化工心。\n笋舆未得乘佳兴，漫向良朋寄短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翕乐堂","author":"吴与弼","text":"宜家信是顺亲方，归有馀师好细详。\n道要何曾离咫尺，事几应不过平常。\n埙篪并入春风软，花萼长和化雨香。\n至德苟能躬不怠，满门和气自多祥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题琴室","author":"吴与弼","text":"一室何妨似斗宽，中含太古兴瀰漫。\n春风几席朱丝缓，夜月轩楹玉轸寒。\n天耸云峰晴簇簇，花穿香涧暗珊珊。\n纤埃不动沉檀细，身世分明在杏坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题野塘新墅","author":"吴与弼","text":"新卜衡茅面野塘，起居长在水云乡。\n庭无尘杂心应远，架有图书贫是常。\n多种桑麻承雨露，任教冰雪积松篁。\n升沉信有平生分，肯学春花逐艳阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9493,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿金石山","author":"吴与弼","text":"间宿仙家陟翠微，石坛旷望本无期。\n轻烟杂树新晴后，近水遥山薄暮时。\n兴逐高歌春脉脉，心悬往事意迟迟。\n素怀欲共何人写，独咏东风月满衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9494,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除日奉和族叔父仰学先生见寄诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"弱质何堪终日病，不才误染一年尘。\n痛惭旧学功焉用，空感春风岁又新。\n困鬣正怜鱼圉圉，芳心谁似木欣欣。\n题诗远谢吾宗老，总抱冲襟未易伸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9495,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"虚堂遥夜忆京师，十八题诗尚记之。\n二纪光阴何太疾，百年事业竟奚为。\n良时孤负追宁及，多病侵陵悔已迟。\n从此残魂须爱惜，闲人闲话不相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9496,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"初晴天气极清妍，况复琴书共晏然。\n心静自应春似海，身閒转觉日如年。\n亲宾漫得诸生应，疾病多便白昼眠。\n准拟花阴分半榻，无怀世上玩先天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9497,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云涧幽居","author":"吴与弼","text":"一带寒流浸白云，千林红叶访徵君。\n小桥乱匝青霄竹，古屋多熏旧日芸。\n细语温淳兼对酒，素琴冲淡更论文。\n欲寻后会无由得，漫喜诸郎继典坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9498,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"朔风雨霰夜漫漫，病骨偏惊败絮寒。\n应有贱贫寒胜我，斯人谁道一般看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9499,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓宝应寺 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"昼梦无人搅，春窗一味幽。\n芳心怜露草，清韵爱晴鸠。\n踪迹何须泥，琴书且暂留。\n微吟时出院，随意弄寒流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9500,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓宝应寺 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"古塔多高兴，重临又几年。\n云烟清晓际，花柳仲春天。\n病眼得无恙，尘襟已旷然。\n题诗人欲去，好鸟正蹁跹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9501,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"行色一身轻，春山鸟乱鸣。\n好怀人共赋，佳兴自能乘。\n花坞官桥晓，云林牧里清。\n素心无物我，取次话平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9502,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"放水","author":"吴与弼","text":"秋风淅淅月辉辉，又是田头放水时。\n坐倚老梅怡病眼，偶逢佳兴一题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9503,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人","author":"吴与弼","text":"琴书深托绿萝溪，风月何人共品题。\n流水旧穿幽径转，乔林新与碧云齐。\n一犁春雨儿耕稼，百瓮寒泉自灌畦。\n随分无非安稳地，相逢何必问丹梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9504,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"小春风日佳，意适浑无我。\n儿女笑相随，缘山摘霜果。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9505,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀曾祖楚江先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"先生苦学绍专门，贫贱逾知德义尊。\n惟是劫灰堪恨处，不馀一字示诸孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9506,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀曾叔祖脩辅训导先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"先生清苦古人俦，六籍研精仕更优。\n愧我痴顽成底事，几回遥感旧弓裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9507,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听小女弹琴","author":"吴与弼","text":"幽栖心迹似洪荒，花木阴阴日正长。\n读罢又亲窗下枕，薰风一曲午天凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9508,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同陈正言登李家山次朱子游山诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"静来荣辱淡无惊，却喜閒身去就轻。\n心目开明随地好，山川奇胜自天成。\n短筇密倚经行稳，磐石徐登发咏清。\n却忆携琴曾此憩，尘寰寒暑几回更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9509,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出游","author":"吴与弼","text":"晴光又值小春天，儿女嬉随度野田。\n香稻可人时有赖，红尘隔我利无牵。\n平冈暂为寻幽历，细草聊因养病眠。\n随处会心皆妙境，乾坤生意总悠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9510,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅旧藁毕偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"连日频将旧稿披，恍然如梦对当时。\n知非已晚嗟何及，空使残魂咏小诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9511,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"吴与弼","text":"物我悠悠付两忘，莫春天气体平康。\n奇花杂映阶篱烂，佳木频分户牖香。\n童冠芳盟六七辈，圣贤名教两三行。\n呼儿杖策嬉游罢，又复高眠向北窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9512,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上偶成 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"尝闻洪范思能睿，只恐邪思乱性真。\n能于思处分真妄，便是存心格物人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9513,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上偶成 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"妄想能除心即清，心清一气自和平。\n时行时止非人力，慎勿憧憧役此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9514,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"竹树阴阴隔世尘，吾伊声里着斯人。\n饥餐渴饮聊随分，信是閒中别有春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9515,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿周舍","author":"吴与弼","text":"暮色看山罢，清宵寄此楼。\n细思名教旨，衰懒是吾忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9516,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿湖田万氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"数家书屋湖山上，我爱湖山几度游。\n下榻又从高阁卧，炎窗风雨似清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9517,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木黄岭","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶从佳地又开颜，久坐凉飙意转閒。\n平野旷然清远目，白云深处指闽山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9518,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿慈明寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"一宿蔚蓝天，炎襟自洒然。\n五更凉梦觉，心赏淡无言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9519,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄宗人士彰","author":"吴与弼","text":"客路迢迢拟访君，细论心事慰离群。\n新晴无奈归程迫，空向青山望白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9520,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山家","author":"吴与弼","text":"老兄扫径遥迎客，令弟焚香好煮茶。\n自有一般淳朴处，稻花流水两三家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9521,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈广文","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶送邻翁语隔溪，遥瞻骑从识儒衣。\n九天远达尚书命，野水荒山倍益辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9522,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙氏贤母诗","author":"吴与弼","text":"曾向遗经慨小星，柏舟三叹有馀馨。\n高踪百世能同调，不负皇天降此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9523,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"当年曾苦读书心，斯道寥寥强自任。\n不谓阨穷兼疾疹，蹉跎空得雪盈簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9524,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜枕上作","author":"吴与弼","text":"屋弊风如箭，衾单人似冰。\n但怜妻子病，敢计此身宁。\n夙志空怀古，迂谋拙理生。\n体羸何所作，漫喜此心平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9525,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上绝句","author":"吴与弼","text":"风雪无眠夜，泠然细省躬。\n此心诚易失，物理倍难穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9526,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小年夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"虚堂明烛小年时，子弄瑶琴父咏诗。\n会得心中无事旨，乐夫天命复奚疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9527,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪畔偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶来溪畔爱阳坡，瞑坐光风养太和。\n幸托林泉交物少，故于情性得功多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9528,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长塘道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"讲罢归来日向沉，嫩凉徐步爱轻阴。\n芳林秀町盈眸好，谁识乾坤造化心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9529,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"月色秋边白，人心夜半平。\n一尘元不滓，高枕玩虚明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9530,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璿庆夜读喜而赋此勉焉","author":"吴与弼","text":"八岁知勤学，焚膏过二更。\n圣功从此始，道只在人弘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9531,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中夜偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"病枕醒来镇不眠，起看星象听鸣泉。\n寸心敛处能容物，始识天君本泰然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9532,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽梁节","author":"吴与弼","text":"颍水翱翔迈等俦，亭亭丹桂倚高秋。\n姓名未达黄金阙，梦寐俄惊白玉楼。\n堂上幸仍新滫瀡，庭前堪付旧弓裘。\n盈虚消息何须计，没有清芬是乃休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9533,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦戴时雨训导","author":"吴与弼","text":"记得当年听说诗，客窗几度解人颐。\n清风久矣隔今古，又向良宵一梦之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9534,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀族叔父仲学先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆昨相论古市傍，我才逾冠叔方强。\n圣贤事业心皆醉，问学工夫日共忙。\n信是中行难体会，也应夙志易荒唐。\n秋窗卧病思君处，空愧萧萧两鬓霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9535,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲塘","author":"吴与弼","text":"莲没不知年，塘称尚如昔。\n念我名不称，长生谅何益。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9536,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何家山","author":"吴与弼","text":"脩竹淩青冥，乔林郁苍翠。\n三世托吾庐，嬉游十经岁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9537,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坑里","author":"吴与弼","text":"青松夹广路，绿水连芳塘。\n茅屋八九家，风俗如虞唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9538,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南坑","author":"吴与弼","text":"田宜晚粒香，池济秋阳曝。\n南坑专此嘉，吾人竟何谷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9539,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南冈","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆年童稚时，逐侣于兹牧。\n赓歌忘渴饥，皞皞驱归犊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9540,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对门山","author":"吴与弼","text":"土鼓供儿戏，林泉多珍味。\n风物自依然，流光换人世。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9541,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下廒山","author":"吴与弼","text":"为童多此游，负薪给吾爨。\n几度江湖上，青山梦中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9542,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]